# Applies only to builds that use this Dockerfile (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile). The repo-root build in
# docker-compose.gantry.yml sends the whole repo as context, so keep host
# installs and build output out of it: a Windows node_modules copied over the
# image's Linux one would break native modules (better-sqlite3, rolldown).
**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
